Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:16.12,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 WTA1000 第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:16.12,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}斯瓦泰克 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-3 6-0{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 阿朗戈 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.22,0:00:01.90,EN,,0,0,0,,It's long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.22,0:00:01.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,出界了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.90,0:00:04.38,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, it was virtually perfect second set
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.90,0:00:04.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,这第二盘打得几乎完美
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:05.74,EN,,0,0,0,,for Iga.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:05.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:08.94,EN,,0,0,0,,Absolutely flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:08.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,整个人像在飞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:10.30,EN,,0,0,0,,Arango made a good start.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:10.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,阿朗戈开局不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:11.02,EN,,0,0,0,,the better start
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:11.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,开局是她更好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.02,0:00:12.78,EN,,0,0,0,,and was a break up early on but after
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.02,0:00:12.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,早早破了一个发球局 可那之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:16.54,EN,,0,0,0,,that break she made just one more game
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:16.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,她只再拿下了一局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:18.94,EN,,0,0,0,,and in the end a bagel in the second set
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:18.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二盘最后是六比零
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:21.02,EN,,0,0,0,,that looked likely I have to say
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:21.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话这个结果早看得出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:24.30,EN,,0,0,0,,from the second point no kidding of this set
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:24.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,从这一盘的第二分起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.30,0:00:25.90,EN,,0,0,0,,and she just would not release
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.30,0:00:25.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,她一点都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:29.34,EN,,0,0,0,,the throttle wasn't expected to win
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:29.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,松开油门 本来也没人看好她
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.34,0:00:31.10,EN,,0,0,0,,and once again she gets just three games
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.34,0:00:31.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,她又一次只拿到三局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.10,0:00:32.38,EN,,0,0,0,,as she did in the first meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.10,0:00:32.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,和两人第一次交手时一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.38,0:00:33.26,EN,,0,0,0,,between the two
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.38,0:00:33.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,那一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.26,0:00:35.58,EN,,0,0,0,,on the US hard courts last year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.26,0:00:35.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,是去年在美国的硬地上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:36.46,EN,,0,0,0,,through the third
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:36.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,打到第三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:38.94,EN,,0,0,0,,as a big Iga Swiatek fan I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:38.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,作为斯瓦泰克的铁杆球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:40.38,EN,,0,0,0,,am and so are the fans here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:40.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是 在场的观众也是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.38,0:00:41.18,EN,,0,0,0,,It was really cool
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.38,0:00:41.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,特别过瘾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.18,0:00:43.42,EN,,0,0,0,,to watch you ease your way into that match
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.18,0:00:43.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,看着你一点点进入这场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.42,0:00:44.46,EN,,0,0,0,,and find your stride.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.42,0:00:44.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,找到自己的节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.46,0:00:45.18,EN,,0,0,0,,You must be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.46,0:00:45.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天这场表现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.18,0:00:47.10,EN,,0,0,0,,with your performance today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.18,0:00:47.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,你一定很满意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.10,0:00:47.98,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, for sure. You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.10,0:00:47.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:49.82,EN,,0,0,0,,it was necessary for me to get
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:49.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,我必须先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.82,0:00:51.42,EN,,0,0,0,,to know the court and find the rhythm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.82,0:00:51.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,熟悉这块场地 找到节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.42,0:00:53.34,EN,,0,0,0,,because it's much different than in Toronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.42,0:00:53.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里和多伦多很不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:55.18,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I'm happy that, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:55.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我挺高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.18,0:00:56.78,EN,,0,0,0,,I was patient and I came back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.18,0:00:56.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,我沉住了气 第二盘回来时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.78,0:00:58.62,EN,,0,0,0,,for a second set knowing what to improve
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.78,0:00:58.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,已经知道该改什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.62,0:01:02.22,EN,,0,0,0,,and it went pretty smooth from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.62,0:01:02.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,之后就打得很顺
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.22,0:01:03.74,EN,,0,0,0,,How special did it feel to walk out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.22,0:01:03.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天以卫冕冠军的身份
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.74,0:01:05.50,EN,,0,0,0,,on the court today as defending champion
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.74,0:01:05.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,走上这块球场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:06.46,EN,,0,0,0,,and feeling the love?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:06.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉有多特别
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.46,0:01:07.98,EN,,0,0,0,,All the Polish fans here today,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.46,0:01:07.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天来的这么多波兰球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.98,0:01:10.94,EN,,0,0,0,,all the Cincinnati fans, do you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.98,0:01:10.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提的球迷 你听得见吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.94,0:01:12.06,EN,,0,0,0,,I know you have headphones
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.94,0:01:12.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道你戴着耳机
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.06,0:01:13.42,EN,,0,0,0,,on, so I'm not sure if you hear it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.06,0:01:13.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,不确定你听不听得到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:14.22,EN,,0,0,0,,but can you feel it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:14.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,但隔着耳机
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.22,0:01:15.18,EN,,0,0,0,,through the headphones?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.22,0:01:15.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,你感觉得到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.18,0:01:16.94,EN,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of love for you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.18,0:01:16.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里有好多人喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:19.34,EN,,0,0,0,,The music is pretty loud, but I still can hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:19.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,音乐挺响 但我还是听得见
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.34,0:01:20.70,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you guys for the support
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.34,0:01:20.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家的支持
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.70,0:01:22.38,EN,,0,0,0,,and the nice welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.70,0:01:22.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,也谢谢这么好的欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.38,0:01:24.86,EN,,0,0,0,,I love, you know, coming back here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.38,0:01:24.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很喜欢回到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.86,0:01:27.90,EN,,0,0,0,,especially now that the site is so beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.86,0:01:27.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其现在这个场地这么漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.90,0:01:30.46,EN,,0,0,0,,and, brand new, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.90,0:01:30.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,全都是新的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.46,0:01:31.66,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm really happy to be back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.46,0:01:31.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,能回来我真的很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.66,0:01:33.50,EN,,0,0,0,,and I think a lot of people were excited
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.66,0:01:33.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想很多人也都盼着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.50,0:01:35.26,EN,,0,0,0,,to come back after last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.50,0:01:35.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,去年之后再回到这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.26,0:01:37.26,EN,,0,0,0,,All right, next up is Maria Sakkari.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.26,0:01:37.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 下一轮是萨卡里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.26,0:01:38.30,EN,,0,0,0,,You know her game very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.26,0:01:38.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,你很了解她的打法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.30,0:01:39.34,EN,,0,0,0,,She knows yours. She's one
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.30,0:01:39.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,她也了解你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:40.22,EN,,0,0,0,,of the few players
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:40.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,这些年能让你难受的球员不多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.22,0:01:42.06,EN,,0,0,0,,who has given you a hard time in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.22,0:01:42.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,她是其中一个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.06,0:01:44.46,EN,,0,0,0,,but what do you what are we in store
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.06,0:01:44.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,那下一场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.46,0:01:46.30,EN,,0,0,0,,for when we see that next match?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.46,0:01:46.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们能期待什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.30,0:01:48.86,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, for sure. She's a really experienced
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.30,0:01:48.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,那当然 她经验非常丰富
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.86,0:01:52.78,EN,,0,0,0,,and great player, great competitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.86,0:01:52.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,球打得好 也很能拼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.62,EN,,0,0,0,,So, for sure it's going to be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以肯定不好打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.62,0:01:57.18,EN,,0,0,0,,I'll just, you know, prepare tactically
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.62,0:01:57.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,我会把战术准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.18,0:01:57.90,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.18,0:01:57.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后做好准备
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.90,0:01:59.18,EN,,0,0,0,,We already played this season,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.90,0:01:59.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个赛季我们已经交过手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:01.66,EN,,0,0,0,,so obviously we know each other's game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:01.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,彼此的球路都清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.66,0:02:03.18,EN,,0,0,0,,It's going to be about, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.66,0:02:03.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,到时候就看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.18,0:02:04.54,EN,,0,0,0,,who brings better quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.18,0:02:04.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,谁能打出更高的质量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.54,0:02:06.46,EN,,0,0,0,,So for sure it's going to be a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.54,0:02:06.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以这肯定是一场硬仗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.46,0:02:07.98,EN,,0,0,0,,All right, one thing I'd like to say
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.46,0:02:07.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 最后我想说一句
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.98,0:02:09.98,EN,,0,0,0,,to defending champions and players
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.98,0:02:09.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,对卫冕冠军 也对每一位
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.98,0:02:10.94,EN,,0,0,0,,who have won this tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.98,0:02:10.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这里夺过冠的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.94,0:02:12.22,EN,,0,0,0,,before, welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.94,0:02:12.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,欢迎回家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.22,0:02:13.74,EN,,0,0,0,,We love that you're here in Mason, Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.22,0:02:13.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,很高兴你来到俄亥俄的梅森
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.74,0:02:16.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, Iga.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.74,0:02:16.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 斯瓦泰克
